The Mac app is Developer ID signed and notarized. Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 15 or newer. The update trial uses updates.paceman.ai; the stable feed is not being published as part of this trial.

Both desktop archives are built from the same source commit. The Omarchy archive is included for release consistency; Sparkle updating applies only to macOS.
